---
import { type ServicesProps } from '../../types/components';

interface Props extends ServicesProps {}
const { id = "services" } = Astro.props;
---

<section id={id} class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-12 lg:py-24" data-analytics-id="pricing">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Investment Screening -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-sm border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Investment Screening</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Pre-Diligence Technical Gate</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Identify material gaps, execution risk, and documentary silences before committing diligence budget.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            GO / CONDITIONAL NO-GO / NO-GO gate
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Evidence-Grade Register
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Critical Silence detection across technical, contractual, regulatory, and safety dimensions
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Clarification scope for deeper review
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Lender's Technical Review -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-sm border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Lender's Technical Review</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Lender's Technical Due Diligence</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Structured technical assessment for debt providers. Bankability analysis, risk register, and compliance-to-scope matrix adapted to lender requirements.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Bankability Index and confidence statement
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Risk register by dimension
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Compliance-to-scope matrix
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Formal clarification log (RFI register)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Acquisition & Portfolio DD -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-sm border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Acquisition & Portfolio DD</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Technical Due Diligence for Transactions</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Technical due diligence for fund acquisitions and portfolio transactions. Systematic multi-asset risk assessment under deal timelines.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Asset-level and portfolio-level risk scoring
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Degradation and revenue constraint analysis
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Safety and thermal management audit
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Vendor DD report for transaction support
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Independent Technical Assessment -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-sm border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-slate-400 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Independent Technical Assessment</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-white">Objective Technical Opinion</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Objective technical opinion for advisors, committees, and evaluators. Traceable findings with explicit confidence statements — designed to be defended.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Multi-dimensional technical scoring
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Documented decision rationale
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Outstanding items register
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-blue-400">→</span>
            Mandate-specific deliverable format
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Core note -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto mt-8 px-4">
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm text-center border-t border-slate-700 pt-8">
        Every mandate uses the same analytical core: structured evidence ingestion, explicit confidence classification, and traceable decision logic. What adapts is the scope, the required sources, and the deliverable format.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
